ngs to)."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Pronoun\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Possessive Adjective (Singular)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"my\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">My card is red.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"your\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Your house is beautiful.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"his\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">His computer is new.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"her\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Her hair is short.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"its\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Its fur is brown.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Possessive Adjectives go before nouns."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"italic\">Please keep your office neat.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Note: <span class = \"strong\">Its</span> is a Possessive Adjective."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"italic\">The cat's tail is long. --> Its tail is long."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Imperatives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use imperatives to give instructions, orders and warnings.<br/><br/><span class = \"underline\">Please note:</span><br/>Do not use a subject when giving orders.<br/><br/><span class = \"underline\">Example:</span><br/><span class = \"underline\">You wash</span> your hands. \u2718      => Wash your hands. \u2713 <br/><br/>Always use the infinitive form of the verb, without to.<br/><br/><span class = \"underline\">Example:</span><br/><span class = \"underline\">To sit</span> down please. \u2718   => Sit down please. \u2713"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Finish your vegetables."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Wash your plate."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "like to"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to enjoy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to visit the bookstore."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use in a blog."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to hate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to strongly dislike"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I hate going to the library."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to love"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to strongly like"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love learning English."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to travel"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move from one place to another"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to travel."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bookstore"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place to buy books"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I find new books at the bookstore."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le01ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Decide on a topic."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a blog."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a blog about something I like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use correct spelling and grammar when I write about personal interests."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my interests with a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn2le01ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn2le01ob08re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn2le01ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Blog: Travel the World With Sally</span>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn2le01ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Welcome to my life!<br/>\nThis is my blog.", "id": 2, "time": "3500", "image": "engenn2le01ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "My name is Sally. I am from Cambridge, Massachusetts. <br/>\nI love languages! I am learning Spanish at night.<br/>\nI go to the bookstore near the coffee shop with my friends but I hate libraries. They are so boring!", "id": 3, "time": "9000", "image": "engenn2le01ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "I go to yoga on Mondays and Wednesdays. Natalie's sister does yoga too!  It is fun.", "id": 4, "time": "28000", "imag